---
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { contactEmailHref, site } from '../data/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How this portfolio handles website visits and contact by email.">
  <PageHero title="Privacy" intro="A straightforward explanation of how this portfolio works and what happens when you get in touch." />
  <section class="legal-copy">
    <div class="shell legal-copy__inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Updated October 20, 2026</p>
      <h2>Visiting the website</h2>
      <p>This is a public project portfolio hosted on GitHub Pages. The website does not include analytics or advertising trackers, visitor accounts, a newsletter signup, or a contact form. Its own code does not set cookies or store visitor information in your browser.</p>
      <p>GitHub processes information needed to host and secure the website. GitHub states that visitors' IP addresses are logged and stored for security purposes. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/pages/getting-started-with-github-pages/what-is-github-pages#data-collection">GitHub Pages data collection</a> and the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub Privacy Statement</a> for details.</p>
      <h2>Contact by email</h2>
      <p>Email links open your chosen email application. A message is sent only when you send it from that application. Your email address and any information you choose to include are then processed by the email services involved and received for the purpose of your conversation.</p>
      <h2>Links and questions</h2>
      <p>External websites have their own privacy practices. For a question about this portfolio or information you have shared by email, contact <a href={contactEmailHref}>{site.contact.email}</a>.</p>
      <p>This notice will be updated if the website's features or data practices change.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
